### 소개글만 고치기
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/profiles/minji
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "오늘도 카페"
}

### 없는 사람 고치기
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/profiles/haecker
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "안녕"
}

### username 을 바꿔보기
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/profiles/minji
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "haecker",
  "bio": "바뀌었을까요"
}
